00:00:21,340 --> 00:00:26,900
The last two months has been the deadliest conflict in United Nations history,

6
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:31,860
with 133 of their staff members killed.

7
00:00:32,940 --> 00:00:39,900
There have been 212 attacks on Gaza health care facilities since October 7th.

8
00:00:40,560 --> 00:00:46,440
This includes 24 different hospitals that have been bombed by Israel,

9
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:51,140
over 100 ambulances that have been put out of service.

10
00:00:51,140 --> 00:00:58,140
Israel has arrested dozens of doctors, their whereabouts remain unknown.

11
00:00:59,140 --> 00:01:03,140
The head of the main hospital, Shifa Hospital in Gaza City,

12
00:01:04,140 --> 00:01:09,140
Mohammed Abu Salmiya, has been under Israeli arrest since November 22nd.

13
00:01:09,140 --> 00:01:23,140
Many other senior doctors have continued to be held by the Israeli military for almost two weeks with no charges and no one knows their whereabouts.

14
00:01:23,140 --> 00:01:29,140
Rantezi Pediatric Subspecialty Hospital, bombed.

15
00:01:30,140 --> 00:01:34,140
Al Nasser Pediatric Hospital, bombed.

16
00:01:35,140 --> 00:01:38,140
Gaza's Only Eye Hospital, bombed.

17
00:01:39,140 --> 00:01:41,140
Gaza's Only Mental Health Hospital, bombed.

18
00:01:42,140 --> 00:01:46,140
Wafa Rehabilitation Hospital, bombed.

19
00:01:46,140 --> 00:01:57,140
The senior's facility immediately adjacent to Wafa Rehabilitation Hospital, bombed.

20
00:01:58,140 --> 00:02:05,140
Al Jura Children's Hospital, targeted with prohibited white phosphorus, October 12th.

21
00:02:05,140 --> 00:02:17,140
Indonesian Hospital, the only hospital currently operating in the north, still trying to treat patients while being bombed.

22
00:02:18,140 --> 00:02:21,140
Shifa Hospital, bombed.

23
00:02:21,140 --> 00:02:29,140
The two medical schools in Gaza, Islamic University of Gaza, bombed.

24
00:02:30,140 --> 00:02:35,140
Al-Azhar University Medical School, bombed.

25
00:02:36,140 --> 00:02:40,140
Médecins Sans Frontières Ambulance Convoy, bombed.

26
00:02:41,140 --> 00:02:45,140
Red Cross Ambulance Convoys, bombed.

27
00:02:45,140 --> 00:02:54,140
Of 35 hospitals in Gaza as of this morning, 26 are non-functional.

28
00:02:55,140 --> 00:02:58,140
Nine remaining only partially functional.

29
00:02:59,140 --> 00:03:06,140
But they are operating at more than double their capacity, with critical shortages of basic supplies and fuel.

30
00:03:07,140 --> 00:03:13,140
These facilities are also providing shelter to thousands of internally displaced people.

31
00:03:13,140 --> 00:03:23,140
Palestine Red Crescent Society yesterday announced that operations of their ambulances in northern Gaza has stopped.

32
00:03:24,140 --> 00:03:33,140
Due to depletion of fuel, hospital closures, it is now impossible to evacuate wounded people in the north.

33
00:03:34,140 --> 00:03:38,140
Instead, those patients are left to die.

34
00:03:38,140 --> 00:03:50,960
As of this morning, over 17,000 Palestinian people have been killed, including over 7,000 children.

35
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:57,960
There are at least 46,000 people injured, thousands of whom are critically injured.

36
00:03:58,960 --> 00:04:03,960
There is insufficient hospital space to treat even a fraction of these patients.

37
00:04:03,960 --> 00:04:13,960
Massively overcrowded United Nations shelters have become havens to spread infectious diseases, including a hepatitis A outbreak,

38
00:04:14,960 --> 00:04:22,960
multiple meningitis outbreaks, lice, skin infections, and multiple diarrheal illness outbreaks.

39
00:04:22,960 --> 00:04:32,960
The United Nations Human Rights Office has declared on December 5th the pattern of attacks that target civilian infrastructure

40
00:04:33,960 --> 00:04:42,960
raises serious concerns about Israel's compliance with international humanitarian law and raises the risk of atrocity crimes.

41
00:04:42,960 --> 00:04:54,960
There have been immeasurable numbers of violations of special protection to civilians, children, and medical personnel.

42
